  message: "Owner decision 2026-07-12 (design walkthrough): DEFER the entire ADR-0042 survey-rename campaign (S2-S8: constant+import shim, WI-vatuf CLI default+verb, docs sweep, test/scripts sweep, tracker sweep) to the END of Wave 5. Rationale: (1) the campaign full forward isbefore-closure blocks ZERO P1 items -- verified, the closure is 5 self-contained P2/P3 nodes with nothing outside the campaign -- so deferring has no critical-path cost. (2) Ratified-but-unstarted P3 mechanical churn (~65 script refs + docs + fixtures + ~52 tracker items); payoff is naming coherence, not correctness. (3) Executing it LAST is strictly better than now: ADR-0042 sec.4 merges the two divergent resolvers (_discover_input_file + find_behavior_map) and touches cli.py heavily, which would collide with the P1 cli.py/resolver structural work; doing it after that settles avoids the overlap. The 7 todo_soft leaves set to someday + tagged wave5. ADR-0042 stays Accepted and banked; INV-firuh stays violated until S1-S8 land at end of Wave 5."  # d76a
